        "client_msg_id": "416cf0e7-1730-4321-bb44-089209c1aa97",
        "text": "And just FYI, Lydia reached out to me over the weekend and congratulated me on the story. In our conversation, I shared with her that I'd been negotiating with DPH for weeks to get the data. I didn't know ML was going to publish this. That said, I'm OK with it.",
